      "content": "Isolated Vertex"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "If no edge is incident on a vertex, then that vertex is called an isolated vertex."
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "alt": "Isolated Vertex",
      "src": "data:image/png;base64,"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "In the figure, p is an isolated vertex."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Similarly, if no edge is incident to or incident from a vertex in a directed graph, it is called an isolated vertex."
    },
